---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ArtImage from '../components/ArtImage.astro';
---
<Layout title="School Murals | Anna Hileman Art">
  <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-10 py-20">
    <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[color:var(--color-accent)] mb-6">For Schools</div>
    <h1 class="font-display text-5xl lg:text-6xl max-w-3xl">School Murals</h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-xl font-display italic text-[color:var(--color-accent)] max-w-3xl">
      Lasting visual stories that remind students every day that they are seen, supported, and capable.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-8 text-lg text-black/70 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
      School murals transform hallways into places of inspiration, belonging, and pride.
      Each mural is thoughtfully designed to reflect the values, culture, and story of the community it lives in.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-10 pb-16">
    <h2 class="font-display text-3xl mb-8">Every School Mural Includes</h2>
    <ul class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-black/80">
      <li class="flex gap-3 items-start"><span class="text-[color:var(--color-accent)]">&#10003;</span> A collaborative design process tailored to your school's values and culture</li>
      <li class="flex gap-3 items-start"><span class="text-[color:var(--color-accent)]">&#10003;</span> A full-color mockup reviewed before installation</li>
      <li class="flex gap-3 items-start"><span class="text-[color:var(--color-accent)]">&#10003;</span> Original artwork painted directly on-site</li>
      <li class="flex gap-3 items-start"><span class="text-[color:var(--color-accent)]">&#10003;</span> An original poem written by Anna to accompany the imagery</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-10 pb-24">
    <h2 class="font-display text-3xl mb-10">Dual Immersion Academy</h2>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <ArtImage src="Dual-Immersion-Academy-School-Mural-8.jpg" alt="Dual Immersion Academy mural" ratio="landscape" />
      <ArtImage src="DosRiosElementary.webp" alt="Dos Rios Elementary" ratio="landscape" />
    </div>
    <div class="mt-10 max-w-3xl">
      <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-black/40 mb-2">Grand Junction, Colorado</div>
      <p class="text-black/70 leading-relaxed">
        Each school mural is accompanied by an original poem, written by Anna to inspire the
        imagery and deepen the story behind it.
      </p>
      <blockquote class="mt-8 pl-6 border-l-2 border-[color:var(--color-accent)] italic text-lg text-black/80 font-display">
        Beneath the Sun<br /><br />
        Like bobcats bold beneath the sky, we lift our youth, their spirits high.<br />
        With courage and hope, we show the way, to dream, to grow, to seize the day.
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
